            "width": 672,
            "height": 220,
            "content": "## Test data assumption\n\nThe Upsales account needs the **Customer Support** product, and at least one ticket status and one ticket type (read here through Make API Call <code>GET /ticketStatus</code> and <code>GET /ticketTypes</code>; the first of each is used). The ticket is not assigned to a user, because assignment needs a support licence."
